{"sections":[{"slug":"小平维数","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"小平维数"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">小平维数</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“小平维数”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Plain":"\n<blockquote>\n<p>“<span lang=\"zh\">只要有理曲线有形变</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">例如</span> $\\mathbb P^1 \\times C$), <span lang=\"zh\">小平维数就是</span> $-\\infty$.” — <span lang=\"zh\">张鼎新</span> 2023 <span lang=\"zh\">年</span> 4 <span lang=\"zh\">月</span> 10 <span lang=\"zh\">日</span></p>\n</blockquote>\n"}}}]}